    "tpb_book": "<div>工程統計</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>1. Introduction to Probability and Statistics(J. Susan Milton/ Jesse C.Amold/ 吳榮杉)東華書局</div>\n\n<div>2.&nbsp;Excel統計分析實務｜市場調查與資料分析(適用Excel 2021/2019)<a href=\"https://www.google.com.tw/search?sca_esv=561640084&amp;hl=zh-TW&amp;sxsrf=AB5stBgbbxe_ICJERvwKc9g0YIIqb4kktw:1693495242242&amp;q=inauthor:%22%E6%A5%8A%E4%B8%96%E7%91%A9%22&amp;tbm=bks\">楊世瑩</a>&nbsp;碁峯出版社</div>\n</div>\n",
